# Every image built from this repository: never build output, the git tree or
# secrets. The PRODUCT image excludes much more (tests, the interop rig,
# internal/) in docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore - kept apart, because the
# interop rig (docker/testing/) builds from this same root and needs those
# files. Excluding docker/testing/ here once broke every rig image.
build/
build-*/
build2/
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.log
**/.env
**/node_modules/
